<title>JAPAN: Matsushita - 9mth group results.</title>
<headline>Matsushita - 9mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.64 trln	 vs	    5.05 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  250.10		vs	  170.30</p>
<p> Pretax	prft 222.30		vs    loss 10.90</p>
<p> Net	    prft 88.00		vs    loss 99.30</p>
<p> EPS	    prft 38.82 yen	  vs    loss 47.37 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd is a large consumer electronics manufacturer.</p>
